息。Accent: 带有明显的地域口音，语速时快时慢，喜欢在句尾拖长音，带有明显的挑衅与算计感。【演绎风格 / Style & Emotion】Emotion: 狡诈、奸猾、阴郁、见风使舵的市侩感，藏着让人不安的算计。Technique: 1.Breathy/Vocal Strength: 气息短促且不稳，常在句首带出冷笑或吸气声，声音中带有明显的鼻音共鸣，显得阴沉且猥琐。2.Pacing (节奏): 语速忽快忽慢，在抛出诱饵时语速放慢，在逼迫对方时语速突然加快，节奏感极具侵略性。3.Intonation (语调): 语调多变且怪异，常在句中突然压低声音制造压迫感，随后又在句尾拔高，带有明显的嘲讽意味。4.Micro-expressions: 声音中夹杂着短促的嗤笑声或啧啧声，在特定词汇（如“兄弟”、“发财”）上会刻意拉长音并加重鼻音，营造出一种极其不靠谱且阴险的压迫感。\"\n}"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 52, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [644.7935791015625, 428.2486572265625], "pos": [-13.239389419555664, -186.87669372558594], "id": 59, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [38], "label": "字符串", "type": "*", "localized_name": "STRING"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "显示帮助", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [270, 198], "pos": [54.41354751586914, -177.8268585205078], "widgets_values": ["", "", "", "", "", ""], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 29, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "find1"}, "shape": 7, "name": "find1", "link": 30, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "搜索1"}, {"widget": {"name": "replace1"}, "shape": 7, "name": "replace1", "link": 35, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "替换1"}, {"widget": {"name": "find2"}, "shape": 7, "name": "find2", "link": 36, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "搜索2"}, {"widget": {"name": "replace2"}, "shape": 7, "name": "replace2", "link": 37, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "替换2"}, {"widget": {"name": "find3"}, "shape": 7, "name": "find3", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "搜索3"}, {"widget": {"name": "replace3"}, "shape": 7, "name": "replace3", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "替换3"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 40, "type": "CR Text Replace", "properties":